Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains only original content authored for this project. It does
not redistribute any third-party skill, prompt, or documentation text.

Conventions that this repository follows but does not copy:

* Agent Skills file layout and frontmatter conventions (`SKILL.md` with `name` and
  `description`, plus `references/` and `assets/` subdirectories). The public
  specification is maintained at https://agentskills.io/specification
* The `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json` plugin-marketplace layout used by Claude
  Code and compatible clients.
* The `agents/openai.yaml` interface/policy adapter layout used by Codex and other
  OpenAI surfaces.

Nothing in this repository is affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by
Anthropic, OpenAI, or any other vendor. Vendor and product names are used only to
describe compatibility.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Eval fixtures
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Files under `skills/*/evals/files/` are synthetic research fixtures written for
behavioral testing. They paraphrase publicly documented properties of named
published methods for the sole purpose of exercising the novelty-audit workflow.
They quote no source text and reproduce no figure, table, or extended passage.
Each fixture is a test input, not a claim about the cited work; consult the cited
primary source before relying on any statement in them.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Personal profile layer
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Files named `references/personal-*.md` are a swappable configuration slot, not
third-party material. The content shipped in `profiles/default/` is the
maintainer's own research preferences and is published intentionally as the
default profile. Users are expected to replace it; see PERSONALIZE.md.
